 "Lieutenant General", "quote": "Seitz Lieutenant General Richard \"Dick\" Joe Seitz (February 18, 1918 – June 8, 2013) was an American Army officer and paratrooper who, during a 35-year career, commanded the 2nd Battalion, 517th Parachute Infantry Regiment during World War II, the 82nd Airborne Division and the XVIII Airborne Corps.", "original_document_number": 4}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0491-0055941d9d4a:d05", "card_id": "ramdocs-0491-0055941d9d4a:d05:c0", "entity": "General Seitz", "scope": "military rank", "claim": "General Seitz held the rank of Lieutenant General.", "answer": "Lieutenant General", "quote": "^ Lieutenant General George S.", "original_document_number": 6}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0491-0055941d9d4a:d06", "card_id": "ramdocs-0491-0055941d9d4a:d06:c0", "entity": "General Seitz", "scope": "military rank", "claim": "General Seitz's rank was Major General.", "answer": "Major General", "quote": "Major General John F.", "original_document_number": 7}], "current_answers": ["Brigadier General", "Lieutenant General", "Major General"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Brigadier General", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Lieutenant General", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Major General", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
